<title>GREECE: Delos, Alpha lead Greek growth fund returns in Feb.</title>
<headline>Delos, Alpha lead Greek growth fund returns in Feb.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1997-03-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Delos Blue Chips and Alpha Growth funds were leading Greece's 27 growth funds in February with returns of 36.8 and 36.3 percent respectively, the association of institutional investors said in its monthly review.</p>
<p>Growth fund assets under management reached 103 billion drachmas in end-February, making up 2.4 percent of the mutual fund industry's total assets which hit 4.57 trillion drachmas.</p>
